          "author": "Sparkler Learning",
          "description": "Tune Up uses the healing power of music to help children (and the adults who love them) tackle challenges of early childhood, from cleaning up to including others. In each episode, teacher and musician Benjamin Weiner chats with a child about a difficult topic. Together, they write an empowering song to take on the challenge. Tune Up helps children build social and emotional skills, a growth mindset, coping skills, emotional regulation, resilience, and mindfulness. It's also FUN and a perfect co-listening experience for kids and their grown-ups.",
